{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02906","headline":"奉和圣制过温汤 · 郑义真","name":"奉和圣制过温汤","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洛川方驻跸，丰野暂停銮。\n汤泉恒独涌，温谷岂知寒。\n漏鼓依岩畔，相风出树端。\n岭烟遥聚草，山月迥临鞍。\n日用诚多幸，天文遂仰观。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑义真","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02906.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02906","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}